<div class="cb-feature-grid"><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/clipboard.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">Assessment</span></div><h3>Knowledge-readiness assessment</h3><p>Build a readiness profile across Tourism knowledge, Communication, Workplace and Digital skills through diagnostics and course assessments.</p></article><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/bullseye.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">Career guidance</span></div><h3>Evidence-based career matching</h3><p>Explore active tourism career pathways using your profile and completed learning evidence, with clear reasons for each recommendation.</p></article><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/chart-increasing.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">Development</span></div><h3>Skills gap insights</h3><p>See assessed strengths and areas to improve. Use course recommendations and faculty feedback to plan your next learning step.</p></article><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/bar-chart.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">Faculty</span></div><h3>Teaching & progress monitoring</h3><p>Create courses, review source-based drafts, assign learning and monitor assigned students, attempts, activity time and practical submissions.</p></article><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/robot.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">AI assistance</span></div><h3>Reviewed course drafting</h3><p>Turn text-based PDF, DOCX or PPTX material into an editable draft when AI is configured. Faculty review all questions before publishing.</p></article><article class="cb-feature-card"><div class="cb-feature-top"><span class="cb-icon-tile"><img class="cb-fluent-emoji" src="/images/fluent-emoji/down-arrow.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"></span><span class="cb-tag">Achievements</span></div><h3>Certificates & learning records</h3><p>Track course progress, earn badges and certificates after meeting completion requirements, and download your learning records.</p></article></div>
